-- RAIDER_ONLY: allowed ONLY if `mutantOnly`, else `mutantCannotWearStandardArmor`
-- STANDARD: allowed if NOT robotOnly AND NOT mutantOnly, else `cannotWearRobotArmor` / `cannotWearMutantArmor`
